    {
      "tag": "mirror-dfu-util-0.11",
      "title": "dfu-util 0.11 with libusb 1.0.30 and musl, static, for //fw:flash",
      "notes": "dfu-util 0.11, statically linked with libusb 1.0.30 and musl, for x86_64 Linux: the flash tool of //fw:flash (https://github.com/filmil/hdlf_example_sensor/issues/14, step 5). Built by tools/dfu_util (bazel run //tools/dfu_util) in docker.io/library/ubuntu:26.04 pinned by digest, every package from snapshot.ubuntu.com 20261117T000000Z; two builds give the same bytes. Sources, as downloaded and assets of this release: dfu-util from https://dfu-util.sourceforge.net/releases/dfu-util-0.11.tar.gz (sha256 b4b53ba21a82ef7e3d4c47df2952adf5fa494f499b6b0b57c58c5d04ae8ff19e), libusb from https://github.com/libusb/libusb/releases/download/v1.0.30/libusb-1.0.30.tar.bz2 (sha256 fea36f34f9156400209595e300840767ab1a385ede1dc7ee893015aea9c6dbaf). musl, not glibc, so that no LGPL C library is linked into the binary; musl comes from the musl-tools package of the same snapshot. musl's source, Ubuntu's source package for the musl linked in (for GPL-2.0 section 3), as downloaded: https://snapshot.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/20261117T000000Z/pool/universe/m/musl/musl_1.2.5.orig.tar.gz (sha256 a9a118bbe84d8764da0ea0d28b3ab3fae8477fc7e4085d90102b8596fc7c75e4) and https://snapshot.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/20261117T000000Z/pool/universe/m/musl/musl_1.2.5-3build1.debian.tar.xz (sha256 fd50d32f31502322423ff94e982e97e53ca0902660849054414456bcf0dd4d0b). Licences: dfu-util GPL-2.0-or-later, libusb LGPL-2.1-or-later, musl MIT; dfu-util-licenses.tar holds the three texts.",
      "assets": [
        {
          "name": "dfu-util",
